OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court over deliberate fire
OL,4,Aat empty tenement building
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court charged
OL,7,Fwith wilful fireraising after a blaze
OL,8,Fat an empty tenement building in the
OL,9,Fnorth of Glasgow.
OL,11,FFirefighters were sent to the scene in
OL,12,FStonyhurst Street in the Possilpark
OL,13,Farea of the city at about 15:50 on
OL,14,FSunday 6 September.
OL,16,FGraeme Moxey, 48, did not enter a plea
OL,17,Fat Glasgow Sheriff Court and was
OL,18,Fremanded in custody for further
OL,19,Fexamination.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
